From: acww-3ds <noreply@invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Wide view: villagers walk as seen across the whole picture

A villager walks as seen only inside a rectangle around the camera (FieldVillagerAi::focusRange: 8 units to each
side, 13 back, 5 in front, the DS's picture); outside it (execOffscreen) it only steps along its route. In the wide
view (the 3DS's 400 x 240, the Switch's 426 x 240) that rectangle ended inside the picture, and villagers there
jumped, came in and went out. With the wide view it widens with the picture (x (128 + GPU3D_WIDE_X) / 128, z
120/96, a unit more).
---
 src/ov068/unk_ov068_0225f1a0.cpp | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/ov068/unk_ov068_0225f1a0.cpp b/src/ov068/unk_ov068_0225f1a0.cpp
index 2310178..dd9ecea 100644
--- a/src/ov068/unk_ov068_0225f1a0.cpp
+++ b/src/ov068/unk_ov068_0225f1a0.cpp
@@ -2204,6 +2204,10 @@ BOOL FieldVillager::updateAct() {
     return TRUE;
 }
 
+#ifdef ENHANCED_PORT
+extern "C" int gpu3d_wide_wanted(void);  // (modern/host/gpu3d/gpu3d_geom.c: ACWW_WIDE)
+#endif
+
 FieldVillagerAi *FieldVillagerAi::initAi() {
     using namespace ns_02265324;
     route.resetTarget();
@@ -2213,6 +2217,21 @@ FieldVillagerAi *FieldVillagerAi::initAi() {
     focusRange.posX = 0x10000;
     focusRange.negZ = 0x1a000;
     focusRange.posZ = 0xa000;
+#ifdef ENHANCED_PORT
+    // The wide view (the 3DS's 400 x 240 or the Switch's 426 x 240 around the DS's 256 x 192): the rectangle
+    // around the camera in which a villager walks as seen (outside it only steps along its route: execOffscreen)
+    // widened with the picture and a unit more, else in the margins villagers jumped, came in and went out
+    if (gpu3d_wide_wanted()) {
+#ifdef __SWITCH__
+        const s32 wx = 85;  // (gpu3d.h GPU3D_WIDE_X: the Switch's 426 x 240)
+#else
+        const s32 wx = 72;  // (the 3DS's top screen, 400 x 240)
+#endif
+        focusRange.negX = focusRange.posX = 0x10000 * (128 + wx) / 128 + 0x2000;
+        focusRange.negZ = 0x1a000 * (96 + 24) / 96 + 0x2000;
+        focusRange.posZ = 0xa000 * (96 + 24) / 96 + 0x2000;
+    }
+#endif
     cooldown = 0;
     route.reset();
     stateTimer = 0;
-- 
